      "statement": "strap_skill_publish serializes per library with a for update lock on the creeds row, rechecks owner/admin role, and rejects a stale baseRevision with PT409 (HTTP 409); an identical-content retry (matching files, digest, and archive state) is idempotent and returns the existing document without a new revision.",
