      "id": "claim_b888295f008e4bcead88dc37f887b5d8",
      "statement": "A new skill requires baseRevision 0 and a supplied bundle, enforces a 100-skill-per-library cap (raising 54000/HTTP 422), and on publish increments revision, inserts a complete document into strap_skill_versions, and prunes versions older than revision - 20, keeping the most recent 20 including the current one.",
