    {
      "id": "claim_5da4e07eb7e14845bc10fdca5f775de7",
      "statement": "The per-library storage budget is 64 MiB (67108864 bytes) shared between current strap_skills bundles and retained strap_skill_versions history; on overflow publish prunes the oldest historical copies first (only versions with revision < current, ordered by updatedAt), and rolls back the publication if usage is still over budget, raising 54000 (HTTP 422).",
